## FINAL DIRECTIVE

Start by inspecting the current application and constructing the feature-gap assessment. Then implement the highest-priority missing capabilities in small, safe increments.

**Preservation and correctness take precedence over feature count.** Prefer a well-integrated extension of the existing application over a large rewrite. Prefer a verified improvement over an unnecessary replacement. Prefer a clearly documented limitation over a fabricated capability.

Your final objective is a coherent, secure, maintainable HSE platform in which incidents, audits, risks, corrective actions, field operations, connected devices, and analytics work together through shared business rules and traceable data—without breaking or duplicating the system that already exists.

Begin with the existing application, not a new project.
